{"1.0 turns the view as far as moving a real Wii U GamePad by the same angle would (about twice the controller's turn). The default for a controller, 0.5, lets the view follow it about one to one; with the device gyro the screen you hold is the GamePad, so its default is 1.0.", "1.0 时视角转动的幅度与真实转动 Wii U GamePad 同样角度相当（约为手柄转动的两倍）。手柄的默认值是 0.5，视角基本跟手一比一；用设备自身陀螺仪时，你手里的屏幕就是 GamePad，所以默认是 1.0。"},
{"100% keeps the original field of view. Higher values show more of the world and make Link\\nappear smaller. Applies to gameplay and combat in 2D and 3D. Cutscenes, dialogue,\\nscene transitions and menus keep their authored FOV. First-person view, item aiming and\\nthe Telescope are widened by the same factor, so their zoom is weaker above 100%.\\nMaximum vertical FOV: 110 degrees. Wider settings also widen visibility/culling checks.", "100% 保持原始视野。数值越高看到的世界越多、林克显得越小。对 2D 和 3D 的游玩与战斗都生效。过场、对话、\n场景切换和菜单保持原本的视野。主观视角、道具瞄准和\n望远镜按同样倍数放宽，所以高于 100% 时它们的放大倍率会变弱。\n垂直视野上限 110 度。视野更宽也会加宽可见性/剔除检查。"},
