{"40, 60, 120 and 240 fps: frame interpolation. The game logic keeps its 30 steps a second, and the\\nframes in between are drawn blended (1 in-between frame per step at 60 fps, 3 at 120 fps,\\n7 at 240 fps). The display shows at most its refresh rate: higher choices draw that many.\\n40 fps draws 4 frames for every 3 steps (1 in-between frame per 3 steps), for 40, 80 and\\n120 Hz screens (a Steam Deck set to 40 Hz or 80 Hz, phones with a 120 Hz panel).", "40、60、120 和 240 fps：帧插值。游戏逻辑仍是每秒 30 步，\n中间的帧用混合方式绘制（60 fps 时每步 1 个中间帧，120 fps 时 3 个，\n240 fps 时 7 个）。显示器最多按其刷新率显示：更高的选项会画那么多帧。\n40 fps 时每 3 步画 4 帧（每 3 步 1 个中间帧），对应 40、80 和\n120 Hz 屏幕（把 Steam Deck 设成 40 Hz 或 80 Hz，或带 120 Hz 面板的手机）。"},
{"60 fps interpolation", "60 fps 插帧"},
