{"A multiplier of 1 leaves that state alone. Boost time is how long a full bar lasts; 0 has no limit, and the bar refills whenever you are not boosting. Cooldown is the bar's refill time (0 for immediate refill). With no limit, or with Show boost bar off, no bar is shown; the boost works the same. The bar also hides while a menu, a cutscene or a conversation is on screen. The dash option replaces the walk clip while boosting; full-speed running already uses dash. Sprint pose adds a forward lean and arm drive while running freely, blended with the boost. Rebind the chosen game button in Controls. Roll, then hold A: roll while running and keep A held as you come out of the roll to boost until you let go. It is always held (Press to toggle does not apply) and works on land only.", "倍率为 1 表示不改变该状态。冲刺时长是一整条槽能撑多久；0 表示不限时，不冲刺时槽会自动回满。冷却是一条槽的回填时间（0 为立即回满）。不限时或关闭“显示冲刺条”时不显示槽，冲刺效果不变。菜单、过场或对话出现时槽也会隐藏。“冲刺”选项在冲刺时替换走路动作；全速奔跑本来就用冲刺动作。“冲刺姿势”在自由奔跑时加上前倾和摆臂，并与冲刺混合。可在“操作”页改绑所选按键。翻滚后按住 A：边跑边翻，翻出来时继续按住 A 就会冲刺，松手结束。它始终是按住（“按一下切换”不适用），且只在陆地上有效。"},
