{"Drag to place the picture anywhere. Click or tap a circle to snap it to that spot. Focus the diagram and use the D-pad to move.", "拖动可把画面放到任意位置。点击圆圈会吸附到该位置。聚焦示意图后可用十字键移动。"},
{"Draw optimizations (A/B test)", "绘制优化（A/B 测试）"},
{"Draws the shadow maps at half the size: about 5-7% more frames per second in the busiest views\n(Outset's tall grass, the lookout), but straight shadow edges look wavier.", "以一半尺寸绘制阴影贴图：最吃重的场景大约多 5-7% 帧率（初始岛的高草、瞭望台），\n但阴影的直边会显得更锯齿。"},
{"Draws the shadow maps at twice the size: sharper shadows, but about 17-20% slower in the busiest views\n(Outset's tall grass, the lookout) and more memory.", "以两倍尺寸绘制阴影贴图：阴影更清晰，但最吃重的场景会慢约 17-20%（初始岛的高草、瞭望台），\n且更占内存。"},
{"Dynamic resolution", "动态分辨率"},
{"Each mode keeps its own internal resolution and dynamic resolution;\nthey apply by themselves when the console is docked or undocked.", "两种模式各自保存自己的内部分辨率与动态分辨率；\n插入或拔出底座时会自动切换。"},
{"Edge smoothing (FXAA)", "边缘平滑（FXAA）"},
{"Enabling an experimental mod backs up your saves first. The newest %zu automatic backups are kept; backups made with Back up now are never deleted.", "启用实验性 mod 前会先备份你的存档。只保留最新的 %zu 个自动备份；用“立即备份”做的手动备份永远不会被删除。"},
