{"Esc key", "Esc 键"},
{"Every 5 s the log says each game thread's share of its core ([sched] lines).\nNot saved: off at the next start.", "每 5 秒日志会记录每个游戏线程在其核心上的占用比例（[sched] 行）。不会保存：下次启动时关闭。"},
{"Every 5 s the log says where the game's main thread spends its time in the runtime ([main] lines).\nSaved: it also starts with the game when on.", "每 5 秒日志会记录游戏主线程在运行时里把时间花在哪里（[main] 行）。会保存：打开时随游戏一起启动。"},
{"Every stage", "全部场景"},
{"Experimental features", "实验性功能"},
{"Experimental initial horizontal facing for supported grounded item actions; Leaf gust also follows camera pitch. Lock-on, ongoing first-person aim and other projectile pitch stay native. New item coverage needs gameplay validation.", "为支持的站地道具动作实验性地按相机方向决定初始朝向；“树叶旋风”也跟随相机俯仰。锁定、持续的主观视角瞄准和其它投射物俯仰保持原样。新增的道具覆盖还需要实机验证。"},
{"Experimental: untested. It can break the game or damage your save. Your saves are backed up before it is switched on.", "实验性：未经测试。可能弄坏游戏或损坏存档。启用前会先备份你的存档。"},
