{"First start: the console prepares the graphics of the game once, so that places are not black or late the first time. This takes about 20 minutes, best docked.", "首次启动：主机会一次性准备好游戏的图形，这样新地点第一次进入时不会发黑或延迟出现。大约需要 20 分钟，建议插底座。"},
{"First-person aiming (bow, hookshot, boomerang, telescope, Picto Box, grappling hook) follows\nthe Joy-Con, the Pro Controller or the console in handheld mode, as with the Wii U GamePad.\nThe game's own Options > Gyro switch still applies, and the game ignores the motion while\nthe right stick is pushed.", "第一人称瞄准（弓、钩索、回旋镖、望远镜、照相机、抓钩）会跟随\nJoy-Con、Pro 手柄或掌机模式下的主机，与 Wii U GamePad 一致。\n游戏自身的“选项 > 陀螺仪”仍然生效；推右摇杆时游戏会忽略体感。"},
{"First-person shortcut", "主观视角快捷键"},
{"For a bug report, attach your newest save state and your save file (cking.sav). Save a state at the place of the problem first.", "反馈问题时，请附上最新的即时存档和游戏存档（cking.sav）。先在出问题的地方存一次。"},
{"For testing (not offered to players). GamePad, single screen: play in Off-TV Play from the\ntitle screen on, no controller choice, Minus the item menu. Wii U GamePad and Pro Controller:\nthe game as on the Wii U (TV play, its controller choice); between those two the choice applies\nat once, to or from the single screen from the next start.", "仅供测试（不面向玩家）。GamePad、单屏：从标题画面起就以 Off-TV Play 游玩，不选择手柄，Minus 打开道具菜单。Wii U GamePad 与 Pro Controller：与 Wii U 上一致（电视游玩，并选择手柄）；两者之间切换立即生效，切到或切出单屏则从下次启动起生效。"},
