{"Hold B to stop. What is done is kept, and Prepare graphics continues from here next time.", "按住 B 停止。已完成的部分会保留，下次进入“准备图形”会从这里继续。"},
{"Hold during a cutscene or conversation. Prompts still wait for input. Rebind the selected game button in Controls. Unmuted audio plays at a higher pitch.", "在过场或对话中按住。提示仍会等待输入。可在“操作”页改绑所选按键。不静音时声音会以更高音调播放。"},
