{"Hold the selected button during events to play faster. Choices still wait for input.", "在事件中按住所选按键可加速播放。需要选择的选项仍会等待输入。"},
{"How far one point of mouse movement turns the GamePad (before the sensitivity above). With Steam Input's gyro to mouse, tune this and Steam's own sensitivity together.", "鼠标移动一个点让 GamePad 转多少（在灵敏度之前）。用 Steam Input 的“陀螺仪转鼠标”时，把这里和 Steam 自己的灵敏度一起调。"},
{"How many threads compile the shaders the game is waiting for (a new place, an item seen for the\nfirst time). Not saved.", "用多少线程编译游戏正在等待的着色器（新地点、第一次见到的物件）。不会保存。"},
{"How prompts name the shoulder buttons and triggers. Automatic follows the button prompts: LB / RB / LT / RT with the Xbox look, L1 / R1 / L2 / R2 with the PlayStation shapes, the game's L / R / ZL / ZR otherwise. A fixed choice applies with any face buttons setting.", "提示文字里肩键和扳机键的叫法。“自动”跟随按键提示外观：Xbox 外观为 LB / RB / LT / RT，PlayStation 图形为 L1 / R1 / L2 / R2，其余情况用游戏的 L / R / ZL / ZR。固定选择在任何面键设置下都生效。"},
{"How the game's button icons look, with any face-button setting. Xbox and PlayStation show the button bound to each Wii U action. By position on Xbox, roll shows B and sword shows A. Automatic follows the connected pad; Nintendo keeps the game's look. By label keeps its existing automatic Xbox fallback. Original keeps the game's look. Custom bindings need four distinct face buttons; otherwise the original icons are used.", "游戏里的按键图标用哪种外观（适用于任何面键设置）。Xbox 和 PlayStation 显示绑定到每个 Wii U 动作的键；按位置时，Xbox 上翻滚显示 B、剑显示 A。“自动”跟随所接手柄，Nintendo 保持游戏原样。“按标识”沿用现有的 Xbox 自动回退。“原始”保持游戏原样。自定义绑定需要四个互不相同的面键，否则使用原始图标。"},
