{"Lowers the internal resolution while the graphics chip cannot keep up with the frame rate, down to\\nthe chosen share of it, and raises it again when there is room. The picture is softer while it is\\nlower. Helps where the graphics chip is the limit (phones, older computers at a high resolution);\\nwhen the processor is the limit, the resolution stays.", "当图形芯片跟不上帧率时降低内部渲染分辨率，最低到所选比例，有余量时再升回去。降低时画面会变软。适合图形芯片成为瓶颈的场合（手机、高分辨率下的老电脑）；处理器成为瓶颈时分辨率不变。"},
