{"Off: if this computer cannot reach %d fps, the whole game slows down (the performance\\noverlay then shows fewer than 30 logic steps/s). Turn it on to keep the game's speed.", "关闭：如果这台电脑达不到 %d fps，整个游戏会变慢（性能浮层里会显示逻辑步/秒低于 30）。开启可保持游戏速度。"},
{"On the Wii U you aim in first person (bow, hookshot, boomerang, telescope, Picto Box, grappling hook) by moving the GamePad. This works with the GamePad and the Pro Controller choice alike. The game's own Options > Gyro switch still decides whether it uses the motion, and it ignores the motion while the right stick is pushed.", "在 Wii U 上，主观视角瞄准（弓、钩索、回旋镖、望远镜、Picto Box、钩爪）靠移动 GamePad 完成。选 GamePad 或 Pro Controller 都能用。游戏自己的“选项 > 陀螺仪”开关仍决定是否使用体感，推着右摇杆时会忽略体感。"},
{"On-screen controls", "屏幕触控按键"},
{"One press completes item preparation and use against a locked enemy. Items that already use one press keep their native action; menus and contextual interactions stay native. Outside enemy lock, native aiming is unchanged.", "锁定敌人时按一次即完成道具的准备与使用。本来就一键使用的道具保持原生动作；菜单和情境交互保持原生。未锁定敌人时原生瞄准不变。"},
{"Only accelerates supported upper-body equip and boomerang wind-up for enemy-locked quick use. Does not bypass native readiness or ammo, or change projectile speed or flight/return. Default: vanilla 1x, with quick use off.", "只加快支持的上半身装备动作和回旋镖蓄力，用于锁定敌人时快速使用。不会绕过原版的可用性与弹药限制，也不改变飞行道具的速度或往返。默认：原版 1 倍，快速使用关闭。"},
