{"Player space: turning the controller left or right about the real vertical, however you hold it\n(recommended). Yaw: turning it about its own vertical axis (as if it lay flat). Roll: tilting it to\nthe side like a steering wheel. Tilting its top up or down always looks up or down.", "玩家空间：无论怎么拿，绕真实竖直方向左右转动（推荐）。\n偏航：绕手柄自身竖直轴转动（好像平放着转）。\n翻滚：像方向盘一样向侧面倾。手柄上端上下倾始终对应视角上下。"},
{"Player space: turning the controller left or right about the real vertical, however you hold it (recommended). Yaw: turning it about its own vertical axis (as if it lay flat). Roll: tilting it to the side like a steering wheel. Tilting its top up or down always looks up or down.", "玩家空间：按真实竖直方向左右转手柄，不管怎么拿（推荐）。“偏航”：绕手柄自身竖轴转（就像平放时转动）。“翻滚”：像方向盘一样侧倾。把顶端向上或向下倾斜始终是抬头或低头。"},
