{"Saves a small portable state in the background into Auto save 1 to 3, the oldest first. If the game is in a cutscene or dialogue, it tries again a little later. Separate from Crash Recovery.", "在后台把游戏存成便携状态，依次写入自动存档 1 到 3，最旧的先覆盖。若正处在过场或对话中，会稍后再试。与“崩溃恢复”互相独立。"},
{"Saves my-template.bin in the screenshots folder: the shader states and pipelines this computer\nrecorded, as hashes and settings only (no shader code, no game data). Attach it to issue #177\nso the next release prepares them for everyone.", "把 my-template.bin 存到截图文件夹：这台机器记录到的着色器状态与管线（只有哈希和参数，不含着色器代码，也不含游戏数据）。附到 issue #177 上，下个版本就能为所有人预先准备好。"},
{"Saves my-template.bin in the screenshots folder: the shader states and pipelines this computer\\nrecorded, as hashes and settings only (no shader code, no game data). Attach it to issue #177\\nso the next release prepares them for everyone.", "把 my-template.bin 存到截图文件夹：这台机器记录到的着色器状态与管线，\n只有哈希和设置（不含着色器代码，也不含游戏数据）。附到 issue #177\n上，下个版本就能为所有人预先准备好。"},
{"Saves the game into automatic states in the background and records the controller input since the latest one. After a crash, the crash log says how to load it. Saving freezes the game for a moment.", "在后台把游戏存成自动状态，并记录自上一次状态以来的手柄输入。崩溃后，崩溃日志会说明如何读取。保存的瞬间游戏会卡顿一下。"},
{"Saves the whole running game instead (about 300 MB per slot), exactly as it is. These files contain game code and data: never attach them to a bug report.", "改为保存整个运行中的游戏（每格约 300 MB），完全原样。这些文件含游戏代码和数据：绝不要附在问题反馈里。"},
