{"Settings overlay: Esc or F1 (Fn+F1 on most Mac keyboards), Cmd+, or Settings... in the app menu, or hold Select / press Home on a controller. With a captured mouse, the first Esc frees the mouse. Esc, F1 or B closes. ", "设置菜单：Esc 或 F1（多数 Mac 键盘为 Fn+F1）、Cmd+, 或应用菜单里的“设置…”，或按住 Select / 按手柄 Home 键。鼠标被捕获时，第一次 Esc 会先释放鼠标。Esc、F1 或 B 关闭。"},
{"Settings overlay: Esc or F1, or hold Select / press Home on a controller. With a captured mouse, the first Esc frees the mouse. Esc, F1 or B closes. ", "设置菜单：Esc 或 F1，或按住 Select / 按手柄 Home 键。鼠标被捕获时，第一次 Esc 会先释放鼠标。Esc、F1 或 B 关闭。"},
{"Settings overlay: hold Minus for half a second (a short Minus goes to the game). B or Minus closes. L / R switch tabs. The game keeps running and sees no input while this menu is open.", "设置菜单：按住 Minus 半秒（短按 Minus 会传给游戏）。B 或 Minus 关闭。L / R 切换页签。菜单打开时游戏继续运行，但不接收输入。"},
{"Settings overlay: hold Select / press Home on a controller. B closes. L / R switch tabs. The game keeps running and sees no input while this menu is open.", "设置菜单：按住 Select / 按手柄 Home 键。B 关闭。L / R 切换页签。菜单打开时游戏继续运行，但不接收输入。"},
