{"Sharpens textures seen at an angle (the ground ahead, walls along a path) instead of letting them\nblur. It costs GPU time, which can lower the frame rate in the busiest views (Outset's tall\ngrass, the lookout): measured about 5% at 2x, 15% at 4x and 30% at 16x there; the village\nand the sea are not affected. Default: 1x (off).", "让斜向看到的纹理（前方的地面、路边的墙面）保持清晰，而不是糊成一片。\n会消耗 GPU 时间，在最吃重的场景可能掉帧（初始岛的高草、瞭望台）：\n实测那里 2x 约 -5%、4x 约 -15%、16x 约 -30%；村庄和海面不受影响。\n默认：1x（关闭）。"},
{"Sharper picture and cleaner upscaling (AMD FSR 1). Below the window size (docked 720p on 1080p,\nor dynamic resolution) it upscales along edges; at window size it only sharpens. Costs GPU time.", "画面更锐利、缩放更干净（AMD FSR 1）。低于窗口尺寸时（底座 720p 输出到 1080p，\n或动态分辨率）会沿边缘缩放；等于窗口尺寸时只做锐化。会消耗 GPU 时间。"},
