{"SwitchWakerHD %s is out (you have %s): update it with the installer; your saves stay.", "SwitchWakerHD %s 已发布（你当前是 %s）：请用安装器更新，存档会保留。"},
{"Switches off every mod, built-in ones included, in the current profile.", "关闭当前方案里的所有 mod，包括内置的。"},
{"System driver", "系统驱动"},
{"Taken when you quit the game (on Android also when the app goes to the background), unless a cutscene or dialogue is running then. A small portable state: your progress and where Link stands.", "退出游戏时保存一次（安卓上切到后台时也会），若当时正在过场或对话则跳过。只存一个小的便携状态：你的进度和林克的位置。"},
{"Tap a controller button, or hold one and press another.", "点一下手柄按钮，或按住一个再按另一个。"},
{"Test speakers", "测试扬声器"},
{"Test: the game's Miiverse thread (Tingle Bottle and Miiverse requests, which always fail here) stops\ninstead of running a step every millisecond. Measured: no change in fps or\nmain-thread time in the four Outset views. Not saved: off at the next start.", "测试：停掉游戏的 Miiverse 线程（叮当瓶和 Miiverse 请求，在这里总是失败），不再每毫秒跑一步。实测：四个 outset 视角下 fps 和主线程耗时都没有变化。不会保存：下次启动时关闭。"},
{"Tests and diagnostics for developers. Nothing here is needed to play.", "供开发者使用的测试与诊断。玩游戏不需要这里的任何东西。"},
{"That key is used for ", "该按键已用于 "},
{"The Joy-Con or the Pro Controller vibrates when the game asks for it, as the Wii U\ncontrollers did. Off keeps the motors still.", "游戏要求时 Joy-Con 或 Pro 手柄会震动，与 Wii U 手柄一致。\n关闭则不震动。"},
{"The Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker HD - native port (%s host, %s renderer)", "《塞尔达传说：风之杖 HD》原生移植版（%s 宿主，%s 渲染器）"},
{"The TV window (Cmd+F); remembered for the next start", "电视窗口（Cmd+F）；会记住到下次启动"},
{"The TV window (F11 or Alt+Enter); remembered for the next start", "电视窗口（F11 或 Alt+Enter）；会记住到下次启动"},
{"The battery is at %u%%: connect the charger or dock the console first.", "电量仅剩 %u%%：请先接上充电器或插上底座。"},
{"The button also keeps its normal use. Link drops off ledges instead of jumping when automatic ledge jumps are off; press the button just after leaving the edge to jump. The moon jump cheat takes L while it is on.", "按键同时保留原本用途。关闭自动跳崖后，林克走到边缘会掉下去而不是跳；离开边缘后立刻按该键即可跳。月亮跳作弊开启时会占用 L 键。"},
{"The console prepares each graphics effect the first time it is drawn, so new places can look black or show objects late for a few seconds. Prepare graphics does it for the whole game at once: the game visits every place by itself (30-40 minutes, best docked), then restarts at the title screen. Your saves are not touched.", "主机在每种图形效果第一次绘制时才会准备它，所以新地点可能先黑一下或几秒后才出现物件。“准备图形”会一次性把整个游戏准备好：游戏自行跑遍每个地点（30-40 分钟，建议插底座），然后重启到标题画面。你的存档不会被动到。"},
{"The download failed. Check your internet connection and try again.", "下载失败。请检查网络连接后重试。"},
{"The downloaded mod didn't pass the check. Try again later.", "下载的 mod 未通过校验。请稍后重试。"},
{"The game as it was: 30 logic steps and 30 drawn frames a second.", "游戏原本的样子：每秒 30 步逻辑、绘制 30 帧。"},
{"The game closes.", "游戏将关闭。"},
{"The game has its save files open while it runs, so the restore happens at the next start, before the game loads any save. Anything you save until then is replaced.", "游戏运行时会一直打开存档文件，所以恢复会在下次启动、读取任何存档之前进行。在这之前新存的进度都会被替换。"},
{"The game is visiting every place by itself to prepare its graphics, with the sound and rumble off. It restarts at the title screen when it is done. Your saves are not touched.", "游戏正在自行跑遍每个地点来准备图形，期间关闭声音与震动。完成后会重启到标题画面。你的存档不会被动到。"},
{"The game logic keeps 30 steps a second and a blended frame is drawn between them:\ndoubles the drawing work, so it also needs a big overclock to hold 60 fps.", "游戏逻辑仍是每秒 30 步，中间额外绘制一帧混合画面：\n绘制工作量翻倍，因此同样需要大幅超频才能稳定 60 fps。"},
{"The game picks its text language from the console language. Its language packs (content/Common/Pack) were not found, so every language is offered; the game shows only those its disc carries.", "游戏根据主机语言决定文字语言。没有找到它的语言包（content/Common/Pack），因此列出全部语言；游戏只会显示光盘里带的那些。"},
{"The game picks its text language from the console language. This game (%s) contains %s; the other languages need a disc that carries them.", "游戏根据主机语言决定文字语言。本作（%s）包含%s；其他语言需要带该语言的光盘。"},
{"The game's own shadow map size, as on the Wii U. Default.", "游戏自身的阴影贴图尺寸，与 Wii U 上一致。默认。"},
{"The glow around the sky and bright places, as on the Wii U.\nCosts a little GPU time.", "天空和明亮处的光晕，与 Wii U 上一致。\n会占用少量 GPU 时间。"},
{"The mod couldn't be switched off for the update.", "无法为更新关闭该 mod。"},
{"The mod couldn't be switched on.", "无法开启该 mod。"},
{"The mod is no longer installed.", "该 mod 已不再安装。"},
{"The mod or the profile changed. Cancel and start again.", "mod 或方案有变化。请取消后重新开始。"},
{"The setup builds it in the background; you can keep playing. Its notification and screen can pause it.", "后台正在构建，你可以继续游玩。它的通知和画面可以让它暂停。"},
{"The soft dark corners and creases the game adds where surfaces meet. Off draws them flat and is about 1%\nfaster in the busiest views (Outset's tall grass, the lookout); the real shadows stay. Default: on.", "游戏在表面相接处加的柔和暗角与褶皱。关闭后这些地方会显得平，最吃重的场景大约快 1%\n（初始岛的高草、瞭望台）；真实阴影仍然保留。默认：开。"},
{"The world editor's handles use ImGuizmo (MIT License, Cedric Guillemet).", "世界编辑器的操纵柄使用 ImGuizmo（MIT 许可，Cedric Guillemet）。"},
