{"This mod needs code-mod support. It is added once: the game code is rebuilt (about 5 minutes, it can cost a little performance) and the game restarts by itself.", "该 mod 需要代码 mod 支持。只需添加一次：会重新编译游戏代码（约 5 分钟，可能略微影响性能），之后游戏会自动重启。"},
{"This mod needs the Story Notebook: it is being installed; switch this mod on again afterwards.", "该 mod 需要“剧情笔记本”：它正在安装，完成后再开启这个 mod。"},
