{"Warning: warping can break the story. Going somewhere before the game gets there can leave events in that place stuck or out of order, and the game may save it. Try it on a copy of your save.", "警告：传送可能破坏剧情。在游戏自然到达之前先过去，可能让该地点的事件卡住或错乱，游戏还可能把它存档。请在存档的副本上尝试。"},
{"Warp", "传送"},
{"What is prepared so far is kept; Prepare graphics continues from here next time.", "目前已准备好的内容会保留；下次进入“准备图形”会从这里继续。"},
{"Wheel down", "滚轮向下"},
{"Wheel up", "滚轮向上"},
{"When the computer cannot draw all frames, skip in-between frames instead of slowing the\\nwhole game down. The performance overlay shows how many are drawn.\\nOff: every logic step waits for all of its frames, so if the frame target is not reached\\n(e.g. 120/240 fps at a high internal resolution) the whole game runs in slow motion.\\nSaved separately for 40/60 fps (off by default; on by default on Android and Windows on ARM)\\nand 120/240 fps (on by default).", "当电脑画不出全部帧时，跳过中间帧，而不是让整个游戏变慢。性能浮层会显示实际画了多少帧。\n关闭：每个逻辑步都要等它的所有帧，所以达不到目标帧率时\n（例如高内部分辨率下的 120/240 fps）整个游戏会变成慢动作。\n40/60 fps（默认关闭；安卓和 Windows on ARM 默认开启）\n和 120/240 fps（默认开启）分别保存设置。"},
{"When the console cannot draw 60 frames a second, skip in-between frames instead of slowing\nthe whole game down: the game logic keeps its 30 steps a second. Off: every in-between frame\nis drawn and the game runs slower than real time. Not saved: off at the next start.", "主机无法绘制 60 帧时，跳过中间帧而不是把整个游戏拖慢：\n游戏逻辑仍保持每秒 30 步。关闭：每个中间帧都会绘制，游戏比实际时间慢。\n不会保存：下次启动为关闭。"},
{"When the device gets hot, 60 fps pauses until it cools down. Relaxed and Off keep 60 fps\\nlonger, but the device may slow down or get warm. Normal suits this device; Relaxed waits\\nlonger on any device; Off never pauses 60 fps for heat.", "设备变热时，60 fps 会暂停到降温为止。“宽松”和“关闭”让 60 fps\n维持更久，但设备可能降频或发热。“标准”适合这台设备；“宽松”在任何设备上等得更久；\n“关闭”从不为温度暂停 60 fps。"},
{"When the game asks for text (your name), a text window appears over the game: D-pad / left stick choose a key, A types it, B deletes, X adds a space, Y is Shift, L / R switch between letters, accents and symbols, Start confirms.", "游戏要求输入文字（你的名字）时，会在画面上弹出输入窗：十字键 / 左摇杆选键，A 输入，B 删除，X 加空格，Y 当 Shift，L / R 在字母、重音和符号之间切换，Start 确认。"},
{"When the game asks for text (your name), a text window appears over the game: type on the keyboard (Enter = OK, Esc = Cancel), click the on-screen keys, or use a controller: D-pad / left stick choose a key, A types it, B deletes, X adds a space, Y is Shift, L / R switch between letters, accents and symbols, Start confirms.", "游戏要求输入文字（你的名字）时，会在画面上弹出输入窗：用键盘输入（Enter 确定，Esc 取消），点击屏幕上的按键，或用手柄：十字键 / 左摇杆选键，A 输入，B 删除，X 加空格，Y 当 Shift，L / R 在字母、重音和符号之间切换，Start 确认。"},
{"Where the renderer spends its time over the last few seconds, as text for a bug report:\nturn on \"Render profiler (slower)\", play in the spot, then save. File in sdmc:/switch/wwhd/logs/.", "把最近几秒渲染器的时间花费导出为文本，用于问题反馈：打开“渲染性能分析（较慢）”，到该地点玩一会再保存。文件在 sdmc:/switch/wwhd/logs/。"},
{"Which physical button does each Wii U action. By position: right is A, bottom B, top X and left Y. By label: A does A, B does B, X does X and Y does Y. Automatic reads the connected pad's labels. Button prompts below chooses how those buttons look in the game. Only the four face bindings change.", "每个 Wii U 动作对应你的哪个物理按键。按位置：右=A、下=B、上=X、左=Y。按标识：A 就是 A、B 就是 B、X 就是 X、Y 就是 Y。“自动”读取所接手柄的标识。下面的“按键提示”决定这些按键在游戏里的显示外观。只有四个面键的绑定会改变。"},
{"While the TV picture is shown, the GamePad's (items, map) also appears small in the\nbottom right corner, and the touch screen works inside it. Only with the GamePad chosen above.", "显示电视画面时，GamePad 的内容（道具、地图）也会以小块显示在右下角，触摸屏在该区域内可用。仅在上面选择了 GamePad 时有效。"},
{"While the game aims, the pointer is captured and the mouse turns the GamePad (the mouse camera mod leaves it alone then).", "游戏瞄准时会捕获指针，鼠标用于转动 GamePad（鼠标相机 mod 在此期间不接管）。"},
